\@writefile{lof}{\contentsline {figure}{\numberline {1}{\ignorespaces Overview of the proposed SINNE-KF-aided navigation framework. A sliding window of recent inertial measurements is processed by SINNE-KF to estimate the inertial sensor noise standard deviations, which are then used to adapt the process noise covariance matrix of the selected navigation filter (EKF, UKF, or IKF). In parallel, the raw inertial and DVL measurements are directly fused by the navigation filtering framework for state estimation.}}{4}{figure.1}\protected@file@percent }
\newlabel{propose_app}{{1}{4}{Overview of the proposed SINNE-KF-aided navigation framework. A sliding window of recent inertial measurements is processed by SINNE-KF to estimate the inertial sensor noise standard deviations, which are then used to adapt the process noise covariance matrix of the selected navigation filter (EKF, UKF, or IKF). In parallel, the raw inertial and DVL measurements are directly fused by the navigation filtering framework for state estimation}{figure.1}{}}
